{"1332820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Liha", "steam_appid": 1332820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIHA: Dive Zero is a zero-gravity roguelike shooter where every descent of your rusty ship into the anomaly could be your last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a dead and abandoned Earth, ruined by devastating energy experiments, play as scavenger pilot Elisa, diving into underground anomalies in search of worthy loot and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After her boss fails to return from a high-risk mission, you follow his trail into the deepest anomalies to recover him - and the dark secret he took.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332820/extras/55ceb5d855f0d93b4f15ee95512f6c6f.poster.avif?t=1786782225\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332820/extras/55ceb5d855f0d93b4f15ee95512f6c6f.webm?t=1786782225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332820/extras/55ceb5d855f0d93b4f15ee95512f6c6f.mp4?t=1786782225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense combat in all six directions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine weapons into outrageous new creations </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332820/extras/91d312e7329ea5d33d863d40f77fdce1.poster.avif?t=1786782225\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332820/extras/91d312e7329ea5d33d863d40f77fdce1.webm?t=1786782225